eing seen as, useless eaters. That fact demands they be labeled, Willful Idiots. No different than a wolf telling a sheep, that he lovers her and wants to take her to his home so she can meet his parents. She goes along, willingly. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2419142697387476699/comments/default/7443811621435792828'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2419142697387476699/comments/default/7443811621435792828'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/nickel-rides-houdini-suicides-and.html?showComment=1430660203283#c7443811621435792828' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/nickel-rides-houdini-suicides-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2419142697387476699' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2419142697387476699' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-382757517"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 3, 2015 at 7:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1104929907803857940</id><published>2015-05-02T20:02:40.945-06:00</published><updated>2015-05-02T20:02:40.945-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It is almost laughable that the Baltimore Police a...</title><content type='html'>It is almost laughable that the Baltimore Police are alleging that this man killed himself in the van. Severing ones own spinal column is Would be very difficult, if it even possible. hopefully the police will be found guilty when the truth eventually comes out. &lt;br /&gt;I am sure they are working overtime to cover up the details of what happened.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2419142697387476699/comments/default/1104929907803857940'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2419142697387476699/comments/default/1104929907803857940'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/nickel-rides-houdini-suicides-and.html?showComment=1430618560945#c1104929907803857940' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/04/nickel-rides-houdini-suicides-and.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2419142697387476699' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2419142697387476699' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-952405697"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 2, 2015 at 8:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5827103686169512454</id><published>2015-05-01T14:25:25.473-06:00</published><updated>2015-05-01T14:25:25.473-06:00</updated><title type='text'>HiPoint handguns are favorites of the local gang b...</title><content type='html'>HiPoint handguns are favorites of the local gang banger crowd where I live-because they are cheap-and work most of the time-this makes them readily available to the local &amp;quot;gang task force&amp;quot; as well.I&amp;#39;m guessing that&amp;#39;s the case in most of the country.&lt;br /&gt;The &amp;quot;Mr. Gray beat himself up and severed his own spinal cord&amp;quot; defense is used by cops everywhere,as is the nickel ride-it&amp;#39;s a favorite of the stormtroopers-in my younger days,I was treated to 